{
  "pages": [
    {
      "page_idx": 7,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "bbox": [
            0.644,
            0.064,
            0.834,
            0.081
          ],
          "content": "The Other Side of Zero"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.144,
            0.121,
            0.28,
            0.141
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Explanation"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.142,
            0.834,
            0.206
          ],
          "content": "Recall the connection between addition and subtraction. For 3+ ?=5, we can find the missing number using subtraction: 5–3=2. That is, subtraction is the same as finding the missing number to be added."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.144,
            0.208,
            0.325,
            0.228
          ],
          "content": "We know that—"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.194,
            0.238,
            0.752,
            0.26
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Starting Floor + Movement needed = Target Floor"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.142,
            0.268,
            0.624,
            0.289
          ],
          "content": "If the movement needed is to be found, then,"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.29,
            0.299,
            0.656,
            0.32
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Starting Floor + ? = Target Floor"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.143,
            0.326,
            0.183,
            0.345
          ],
          "content": "So,"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.355,
            0.77,
            0.377
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Target Floor – Starting Floor = ? = Movement needed"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.143,
            0.387,
            0.316,
            0.406
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "More examples:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.166,
            0.409,
            0.833,
            0.452
          ],
          "content": "a. If the Target Floor is – 1 and Starting Floor is – 2, what button should you press?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.192,
            0.455,
            0.752,
            0.476
          ],
          "content": "You need to go one floor up, so, you should press + 1."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.193,
            0.477,
            0.517,
            0.499
          ],
          "content": "Expression: **(– 1) – (– 2) = (+1)**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.166,
            0.507,
            0.834,
            0.551
          ],
          "content": "b. If the Target Floor is – 1 and Starting floor is +3, what button should you press?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.193,
            0.553,
            0.798,
            0.574
          ],
          "content": "You need to go four floors down, so, you should press – 4."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.193,
            0.576,
            0.522,
            0.597
          ],
          "content": "Expression: **(– 1) – (+ 3) = (– 4)**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.166,
            0.606,
            0.833,
            0.65
          ],
          "content": "c. If the Target Floor is +2 and Starting Floor is – 2, what button should you press?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.193,
            0.652,
            0.766,
            0.673
          ],
          "content": "You need to go four floors up, so, you should press +4."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.193,
            0.675,
            0.513,
            0.696
          ],
          "content": "Expression: **(+ 2) – (– 2) = (+ 4)**"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.707,
            0.307,
            0.73
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Figure it Out"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.738,
            0.833,
            0.782
          ],
          "content": "Complete these expressions. You may think of them as finding the movement needed to reach the Target Floor from the Starting Floor."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.79,
            0.379,
            0.81
          ],
          "content": "a. (+ 1) – (+ 4) ="
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.473,
            0.79,
            0.699,
            0.81
          ],
          "content": "b. (0) – (+ 2) ="
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.813,
            0.379,
            0.832
          ],
          "content": "c. (+ 4) – (+ 1) ="
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.473,
            0.812,
            0.699,
            0.832
          ],
          "content": "d. (0) – (– 2) ="
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.836,
            0.378,
            0.855
          ],
          "content": "e. (+ 4) – (– 3) ="
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.474,
            0.835,
            0.701,
            0.855
          ],
          "content": "f. (– 4) – (– 3) = \\_"
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "bbox": [
            0.448,
            0.971,
            0.551,
            0.985
          ],
          "content": "Reprint 2026-27"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.858,
            0.377,
            0.878
          ],
          "content": "g. (– 1) – (+ 2) ="
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.473,
            0.858,
            0.701,
            0.878
          ],
          "content": "h. (– 2) – (– 2) ="
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.881,
            0.375,
            0.9
          ],
          "content": "i. (– 1) – (+1) ="
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.473,
            0.881,
            0.701,
            0.901
          ],
          "content": "j. (+ 3) – (– 3) ="
